PROJECT BlogAPI

TARGET FASTAPI

DATABASE POSTGRESQL

AUTH JWT

MODEL User
    name STRING
    email STRING UNIQUE
    password STRING

MODEL Post
    title STRING
    body TEXT
    views INTEGER OPTIONAL
    rating FLOAT OPTIONAL

RELATION User HAS_MANY Post

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8
VALIDATE Post.title REQUIRED MAX 120
VALIDATE views MIN 0
VALIDATE rating MIN 0 MAX 5

ROUTE POST /login
ROUTE GET /users
ROUTE GET /posts
ROUTE GET /posts/{id}
ROUTE POST /posts
ROUTE PUT /posts/{id}
ROUTE DELETE /posts/{id}
